<prov:Activity rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#GenerationActivity">
  <rdfs:label>Ontology generation by OntoGeneration Agent (step 4)</rdfs:label>
  <prov:used rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#RefinedTerms"/>
  <prov:used rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#ProposedAxioms"/>
  <prov:used rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#ProposedTests"/>
  <prov:generated rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#OntologyDraft_iteration0"/>
  <prov:wasInformedBy rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#TestGenerationActivity"/>
  <prov:wasAssociatedWith rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#agent_OntoGeneration_Agent"/>
  <prov:hadRole rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#GeneratorRole"/>
  <prov:hadPlan rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#GenerationPrompt"/>
  <prov:qualifiedAssociation>
    <prov:Association>
      <prov:agent rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#agent_OntoGeneration_Agent"/>
      <prov:hadRole rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#GeneratorRole"/>
    </prov:Association>
  </prov:qualifiedAssociation>
  <vaem:rationale>The ontology models all supplied classes, properties, and the Burgos instance to answer every atomic competency question. WaterMeter is subclassed under Device per CQ06. Object properties connect the specified domains and ranges, with usedIn declared for both Sensor and Actuator. Datatype properties carry FunctionalProperty characteristics as they represent single-valued attributes. All proposed axioms are materialized, and sources/rationales map each entity to its originating competency questions.</vaem:rationale>
</prov:Activity>

<prov:Activity rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#OntoCorrectionActivity">
  <rdfs:label>Ontology correction by OntoCorrection Agent (triggered by themis_test) (step 10)</rdfs:label>
  <prov:used rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#OntologyDraft_iteration0"/>
  <prov:used rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#RefinedTerms"/>
  <prov:used rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#ProposedAxioms"/>
  <prov:used rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#ProposedTests"/>
  <prov:used rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#Report_r1_themis_test_9"/>
  <prov:generated rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#OntologyDraft_iteration1"/>
  <prov:wasInformedBy rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#GenerationActivity"/>
  <prov:wasInformedBy rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#Check_r1_themis_test_9"/>
  <prov:wasAssociatedWith rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#agent_OntoCorrection_Agent"/>
  <prov:hadRole rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#FixRole"/>
  <prov:hadPlan rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#CorrectionPrompt"/>
  <prov:qualifiedAssociation>
    <prov:Association>
      <prov:agent rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#agent_OntoCorrection_Agent"/>
      <prov:hadRole rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#FixRole"/>
    </prov:Association>
  </prov:qualifiedAssociation>
  <vaem:rationale>Fixed CQ01 by swapping domain and range of compose to match the test expectation (Asset -&gt; WaterDistributionInfrastructure). Fixed CQ39 by changing duration range from string to float to resolve the conflict with the Themis test.</vaem:rationale>
  <water_prov:correctionRound rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</water_prov:correctionRound>
  <water_prov:correctionOutcome>succeeded</water_prov:correctionOutcome>
  <water_prov:ofRun rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#run_water_only_refinement"/>
  <water_prov:triggeredBy rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/water_prov#tool_themis_test"/>
</prov:Activity>

